  "source": "hand-made (game map, not to scale): Songpa-gu across the Han River. Seokchon Lake (east and west lakes either side of Songpa-daero) is simplified; Another Land on the west-lake island is an original theme park, not a real place. Songpa-daero runs south-east from Jamsil Bridge to the Olympic-ro corner (540, 100), kept clear for Jamsil Station. The east lake is drawn closer to its real size; the west lake keeps room for Another Land. Olympic Park, further east along Olympic-ro, is its own district (olympic-park.json); a lawn and a path run from the east lake to its park. No filler blocks: the open ground by the river and the lakes is left clear."
